{"id":"fa2e95f28acd7f0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe.md","title":"ZFC Model6 Structure Universe","display":"df-zfc-model6-structure-universe — ZFC Model6 Structure Universe","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe"],"display":"df-zfc-model6-structure-universe — ZFC Model6 Structure Universe","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model6-structure-universe — ZFC Model6 Structure Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V\">\\(U\\in V\\)</span> (structure universe)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\\in V\">\\(L,M\\in V\\)</span> (first-order language and candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (source predicate and universe operator).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}structure\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S(M,U,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}structure\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S(M,U,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An arbitrary ordered pair is not automatically a structure; the interpretation data must satisfy the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}structure\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StructureUniverse}_S(M,U,L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land U=\\mathrm{Univ}(M)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":951,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2772","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe.md|58-df-zfc-model6-structure-universe]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}